ue\": \"Password is not verified; any password authenticates a registered account\", \"actual\": \"Account qa.buyer@example.com was registered with password \\\"BuyerPass1\\\". Signing in with \\\"WrongPass999\\\" succeeded: toast \\\"Welcome back!\\\", redirected to /, header shows Sell and the QA Buyer avatar (authenticated session created). The login page itself states \\\"(any password works)\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Own listing detail shows only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" (no Add to Cart/Message Seller); another seller's listing (prod-1, Emma Green) shows Add to Cart + Message Seller and no edit/delete/mark-sold controls. My Listings page lists only own items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by required-field validation (title/description/price marked invalid, no listing created); missing category/condition → toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\"; all fields filled but no photo → toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\", stayed on /create-listing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price -50 with all other fields valid: submit blocked, stayed on /create-listing, input invalid with message \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\" (min=0, type=number). Non-numeric text cannot be entered into the number input.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged out: Add to Cart on /product/prod-1 → redirect to /login + toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\"; Message Seller → dialog shows \\\"Log in to message\\\" (no message form); no Sell or cart control exposed in header (Start Selling links to /register).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"